WEBVTT

00:07:29.096 --> 00:07:32.441
If your work bombed,
not entirely your fault, you know?

00:07:32.465 --> 00:07:34.959
Everyone knew your genius
was kind of lame.

00:07:34.983 --> 00:07:36.017
(Laughter)

00:07:36.041 --> 00:07:39.539
And this is how people
thought about creativity in the West

00:07:39.563 --> 00:07:40.871
for a really long time.

00:07:40.895 --> 00:07:43.471
And then the Renaissance came
and everything changed,

00:07:43.495 --> 00:07:45.786
and we had this big idea,
and the big idea was,

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:49.005
let's put the individual human being
at the center of the universe

00:07:49.029 --> 00:07:50.570
above all gods and mysteries,

00:07:50.594 --> 00:07:52.879
and there's no more room
for mystical creatures

00:07:52.903 --> 00:07:54.671
who take dictation from the divine.

00:07:54.695 --> 00:07:56.806
And it's the beginning
of rational humanism,

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.973
and people started
to believe that creativity

00:07:58.997 --> 00:08:01.337
came completely from the self
of the individual.